---
// PlatformOverview.astro
---
<section class="os-section os-reveal" style="padding: 48px 0 32px; background: #eff6ff;">
  <div class="os-container" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;">
    
    {/* Section Header */}
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 64px; max-width: 700px; margin-inline: auto;">
      <div class="os-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--blue-primary); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.75rem;">
        <span class="os-badge" style="background: var(--bg-blue-tint); color: var(--blue-primary); border: 1px solid rgba(244,114,182,0.2);">PLATFORM OVERVIEW</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="os-h2" style="font-size: 2.8rem; line-height: 1.15; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 800;">
        Everything you need to build and scale your AI workforce
      </h2>
    </div>

    {/* Feature Cards Grid */}
    <div class="platform-grid">
      
      {/* Card 1: Observe */}
      <div class="platform-card">
        <h3 class="platform-card-title">Observe</h3>
        <p class="platform-card-desc">
          Monitor all your AI employees in real-time. Gain complete visibility into every action, API call, and thought process.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Card 2: Evaluate */}
      <div class="platform-card">
        <h3 class="platform-card-title">Evaluate</h3>
        <p class="platform-card-desc">
          Evaluate performance and ensure output quality before it reaches your customers. Built-in grading and rubrics.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Card 3: Automate */}
      <div class="platform-card">
        <h3 class="platform-card-title">Automate</h3>
        <p class="platform-card-desc">
          Put complex workflows on autopilot. Schedule agents to run daily, weekly, or trigger instantly via webhooks.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Card 4: Integrations */}
      <div class="platform-card">
        <h3 class="platform-card-title">Integrations</h3>
        <p class="platform-card-desc">
          Connect with 100+ native tools and platforms. Let your agents read from Salesforce and write to Slack seamlessly.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Card 5: Security */}
      <div class="platform-card">
        <h3 class="platform-card-title">Security</h3>
        <p class="platform-card-desc">
          Enterprise-grade security & privacy. SOC2 compliant, isolated data environments, and strict zero-retention policies.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Card 6: Analytics */}
      <div class="platform-card">
        <h3 class="platform-card-title">Analytics</h3>
        <p class="platform-card-desc">
          Advanced analytics and insights. Measure time saved, success rates, and ROI across your entire autonomous workforce.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    {/* Bottom CTA */}
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 56px;">
      <a href="/features" class="os-btn os-btn-secondary" style="color: var(--blue-primary); border-color: var(--bg-blue-tint); font-weight: 600; padding: 14px 32px; font-size: 1rem;">
        Explore Platform Features →
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .platform-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .platform-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    border: 2px solid var(--blue-primary);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--blue-primary);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 4px;
    transform: translate(0, 0);
    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
  }

  .platform-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0px 0px 0px var(--blue-primary);
    transform: translate(6px, 6px);
  }

  .platform-card-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .platform-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 961px) {
    .platform-card:nth-child(odd) {
      position: relative;
      left: -8px;
    }
    .platform-card:nth-child(even) {
      position: relative;
      left: 8px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .platform-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
